  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zimbabwe Girls Secondary Education 2012 - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen scope and quality of educational service by issuing bursaries, enhance student access, retention and achievement in the secondary cycle with special attention to disadvantaged girls and boys in 1046 schools across 29 districts to complete 4 years secondary education by 2023.  This contributes to the realisation of Global Goal 4.</narrative>
  </description>
